 "decision_rule": "FF_FUTURES_6M is a required AP3 mediator. It may not be dropped or replaced by a proxy without the project lead's explicit approval recorded before any model run.",
 "dates": "Bloomberg trade dates (exchange local, America/Chicago), which equal the US calendar dates of the CME settlements",
 "delivery": {
  "files": [
   "ff_futures_history.csv",
   "ff_futures_static.csv"
  ],
  "also_record": "the date the export was made and the Bloomberg function or add-in version used (a one-line note is enough)",
  "handover": "attach the two files in the chat or place them in a folder connected to this session; they are stored only under native_backtest/data/_licensed/bloomberg/ (git-ignored)"
 },
 "why_these_contracts": "FF_FUTURES_6M on day d uses the contract for month(d)+6 and its previous settlement. AP3 decisions run 2015-02..2026-08 (development replay and the sealed test); each mediator test compares a change with the same-length changes over the 36 months before the window start (first window start 2015-02-01, so the reference period starts 2012-02-01). Dates 2012-01-03..2026-08-31 therefore need exactly the contracts for July 2012..February 2027: 176 contracts. No date after the last decision (2026-08-31) is used."
}
